description	"The Sith Berzerker

This class forgoes any defense, instead relying on speed and physique to physically shrug off attacks. All lightsaber abilities are focused into dealing extremely deadly strikes. 

^2Weaponry:
- Lightsaber
-- ^1Red ^7Style Only
-- 100% More DMG

^5Force Powers:
- Jump  (3)
- Push  (3)
- Speed (3)
- Protect (1)
- Grip  (3)

^8Attributes:
- Melee Resistance
- BP Free Jumps
- Strength (1)
- Force Block (3)
- Heal (3)
- CTF: 35s Respawn

^2Strengths^7: Immense attack-power, very agile and very strong in the force.
^1Weaknesses^7: No Saber defense, Vulnerable against Cortosis SBD Variants and Anti-Jedi Bountyhunters."